\!\(\*StyleBox[\"p\", \"TI\"]\) decimal digits. The parameter \[Alpha] \
controls the split between the real and reciprocal sums in the Ewald \
summation method.", "Documentation" -> None, "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> 
    None, "DownValues" -> 
    Information`InformationValueForm[
