It takes the option dx for the small displacement f(x + dx), which can be a \
number common to all directions or a numerical vector matching the dimension \
of x \[LongDash] the default value is dx = \!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(10\), \
\(-4\)]\).", "Documentation" -> None, "OwnValues" -> None, "UpValues" -> None,
     "DownValues" -> 
